before:
Complete local Go example; the app itself does not execute it:
```go
package main
import ("fmt")
type Counter struct { N int }
func (c *Counter) Add() { c.N++ }
func main() {
 c := Counter{N: 4}
 c.Add()
 fmt.Println(c.N)
}
```

